609 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 360 0 R
/E (ARKON, C.A promotes strategic technological alliances to face the industry's environmental challenges. We offer specialized services in the treatment of drilling fluids, produced water, and other industrial liquids. Our process integrates effluent treatment and solids stabilization through the Landfarming method. We provide a complete solution that includes controlled spraying or the transfer of treated fluids and pit remediation, applying methods that allow for site recovery and vegetation regeneration, thus eliminating environmental risks.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
610 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 360 0 R
/E (This service aims to remove sediments accumulated at the bottom of tanks to transform them into usable crude oil. Through the use of a solvent vehicle \(diesel\) and specific surfactants, we break down heavy particles to reintegrate them as natural crude oil. At ARKON, C.A, we perform this cleaning with specialized equipment and technically trained human resources, ensuring product recovery and an efficient operation in all types of storage tanks.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
